[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 120.789, "timestamp": "00:02:00", "text": "一会儿就到。我稍微更新了一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 125.749, "timestamp": "00:02:05", "text": "它的。所以现在它更具动态性了，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 130.07, "timestamp": "00:02:10", "text": "它叫什么？嗯，动态的，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 133.83, "timestamp": "00:02:13", "text": "文本。我的文本越多，它就会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 137.35, "timestamp": "00:02:17", "text": "均匀分布等等。是的。在顶部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 141.11, "timestamp": "00:02:21", "text": "我的屏幕。那很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 144.55, "timestamp": "00:02:24", "text": "所以，今天今天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 147.43, "timestamp": "00:02:27", "text": "夜幕降临。现在是晚上10点30分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 152.07, "timestamp": "00:02:32", "text": "它。不过，今天我确实想到了一些主意。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 154.55, "timestamp": "00:02:34", "text": "昨天我们停止了直播，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 156.869, "timestamp": "00:02:36", "text": "早上5点，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 162.63, "timestamp": "00:02:42", "text": "呃，所以昨天我在找东西的时候……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 165.19, "timestamp": "00:02:45", "text": "现在我在一些网站上浏览，因为我受到了启发。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 167.27, "timestamp": "00:02:47", "text": "以及所有的一切。所以，我们这些网站"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 169.19, "timestamp": "00:02:49", "text": "昨天检查过的情况和以前一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 172.47, "timestamp": "00:02:52", "text": "天气星球呃，天气星球一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 176.79, "timestamp": "00:02:56", "text": "我觉得这就像一个双人单元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 179.67000000000002, "timestamp": "00:02:59", "text": "嗯，是的。所以我意识到大多数"}]